<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Later akathists to saints and feasts in the Slavic churches</span><span class="sg-chain-h">modelled on the hymn</span></li></ul></section>
